OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAuthor Helen Fielding launches award to
OL,4,Afind the next Bridget Jones's Diary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at an event for the
OL,7,FIndependent, which first published
OL,8,FBridget's diary in 1995, Fielding said
OL,9,Fthe spread of opportunity for writing
OL,10,Fin the UK is "very uneven", adding:
OL,11,F"There's much more opportunity in the
OL,12,Fsouth than in the north, where I grew
OL,13,Fup."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
